		<description><![CDATA[We get so excited to see our customers and friends wearing our dresses that we just HAVE to show them off! Are you wanting to show off your gorgeous new look that you got from us? Then SHOW us! Upload your image here, tag your face and let us see what you&#8217;ve got!

Facebook • http://www.facebook.com/HFHollywood
Twitter • https://twitter.com/#!/HotFrmHollywood
(ᴅᴏɴ&#8217;ᴛ [...]]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>We get so excited to see our customers and friends wearing our dresses that we just HAVE to show them off! Are you wanting to show off your gorgeous new look that you got from us? Then <strong>SHOW</strong> us! Upload your image here, tag your face and let us see what you&#8217;ve got!</p>
<p><a href="http://blog.hotfromhollywood.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/05/customerimages_facebookpromo.jpg"><img src="http://blog.hotfromhollywood.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/05/customerimages_facebookpromo.jpg" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-136" title="customerimages_facebookpromo" alt="" width="700" height="484" /></a></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Facebook • <a href="http://www.facebook.com/HFHollywood">http://www.facebook.com/HFHollywood</a></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Twitter • <a href="https://twitter.com/#!/HotFrmHollywood">https://twitter.com/#!/HotFrmHollywood</a></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">(ᴅᴏɴ&#8217;ᴛ ʜᴀᴠᴇ ғᴀᴄᴇʙᴏᴏᴋ ᴏʀ ᴛᴡɪᴛᴛᴇʀ? ʏᴏᴜ ᴄᴀɴ <a href="mailto:hyperdrive.candice@gmail.com">ᴇᴍᴀɪʟ ᴜs</a> ʏᴏᴜʀ ᴘɪᴄᴛᴜʀᴇs!)</p>
]]></content:encoded>
