		<description><![CDATA[
Oh, don&#8217;t you worry &#8212; we&#8217;ve got you covered! Check out some styles we know will be perfect for that lady in your life this Spring and make sure to get a jump on our offered gift wrap and priority shipping!
Ideas for Optimal Mother&#8217;s Day Happiness:
• Check out this sweet and subtle T-shirt style Sharkbite [...]]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="http://blog.hotfromhollywood.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/05/mothersdayblog.jpg"><img src="http://blog.hotfromhollywood.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/05/mothersdayblog.jpg" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-127" title="mothersdayblog" alt="" width="700" height="484" /></a></p>
<p>Oh, don&#8217;t you worry &#8212; we&#8217;ve got you covered! Check out some styles we know will be perfect for that lady in your life this Spring and make sure to get a jump on our offered gift wrap and priority shipping!</p>
<p><strong>Ideas for Optimal Mother&#8217;s Day Happiness:</strong></p>
<p>• Check out this <a href="http://www.hotfromhollywood.com/sllaraveshhe.html">sweet and subtle T-shirt style Sharkbite dress with beautiful crocheted lace backing</a>! One of our favorites!</p>
<p>• Want something a little more flowy and feminine? This <a href="http://www.hotfromhollywood.com/slroneshlarh.html">sheer layer dress with a satin bow</a> is perfect! Check it out in Teal and Ivory for a beautiful splash of Spring!</p>
<p>• Florals and ruffles couldn&#8217;t be more fitting for a breezy May, right? Take a look at this <a href="http://www.hotfromhollywood.com/oneshflprdes.html">One-Shoulder floral-printed mini-dress</a>. Pair it up with some cute denim leggings and sandals for a perfect breezy outfit!</p>
<p>Take some ideas from these cute Spring suggestions or go off on your own and find something beautiful for your wife, sisters, aunts and daughters! Don&#8217;t forget to opt for gift wrap at checkout and make sure your order is in before Sunday!</p>
<p><em>Trust us, your ladies will thank you!</em></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Facebook • <a href="http://www.facebook.com/HFHollywood">http://www.facebook.com/HFHollywood</a></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Twitter • <a href="https://twitter.com/#!/HotFrmHollywood">https://twitter.com/#!/HotFrmHollywood</a></p>
]]></content:encoded>
