		<description><![CDATA[We know you&#8217;re just like us and you&#8217;re wanting to keep up to date with your favorite musicians, actors and fashions &#8212; we&#8217;re going to make it easy for you! We at Hot From Hollywood want to get to know you and share our love for the vibrant fashions of Los Angeles, so make sure [...]]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p style="text-align: left;"><a href="http://blog.hotfromhollywood.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/04/socialmedia_monitor_small.jpg"><img src="http://blog.hotfromhollywood.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/04/socialmedia_monitor_small.jpg" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-112" title="socialmedia_monitor_small" alt="" width="700" height="491" /></a><strong>We</strong> know you&#8217;re just like us and you&#8217;re wanting to keep up to date with your favorite musicians, actors and fashions &#8212; we&#8217;re going to make it easy for you! We at Hot From Hollywood want to get to know you and share our love for the vibrant fashions of Los Angeles, so make sure to follow, like and subscribe! Stay tuned to our pages for discounts, contests and tips on all of the trends seen out here on the West Coast!</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Facebook • <a href="http://www.facebook.com/HFHollywood">http://www.facebook.com/HFHollywood</a></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Twitter • <a href="https://twitter.com/#!/HotFrmHollywood">https://twitter.com/#!/HotFrmHollywood</a></p>
